da4-5bfa-a879-bcd8318fdf8b" 13194139535508 true] [17592186352728 1145 "For a surface $S$ defined by $z=f(x,y)$ with $(x,y)\\in D,$ the surface area of $S$ is given by\n\n$$\n{∬}_{S}\\,\\text{d}S={∬}_{D}\\sqrt{1+{(\\frac{∂z}{∂x})}^{2}+{(\\frac{∂z}{∂y})}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}A.\n$$\n\nIn this case, our surface is given by\n\n$$\nz=\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}},\\,0\\le x\\le 1,\\,1\\le y\\le 2.\n$$\n\nNow, since\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂z}{∂x} & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}})=\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}}, \\\\ \\frac{∂z}{∂y} & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}})=\\frac{y}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}},\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nthe surface area is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{S}\\,\\text{d}S & ={∬}_{D}\\sqrt{1+{(\\frac{∂z}{∂x})}^{2}+{(\\frac{∂z}{∂y})}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}\\sqrt{1+(\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}})^{2}+(\\frac{y}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}})^{2}}\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}\\sqrt{1+\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}\\sqrt{1+\\frac{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}\\sqrt{1+1}\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}\\sqrt{2}\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & =\\sqrt{2}{∬}_{D}\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & =\\sqrt{2}\\cdot (1-0)\\cdot (2-1) \\\\  & =\\sqrt{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535508 true] [17592186352729 1000 #edb/ref 17592186352730 13194139535508 true] [17592186352729 1000 #edb/ref 17592186352731 13194139535508 true] [17592186352729 1000 #edb/ref 17592186352732 13194139535508 true] [17592186352729 1000 #edb/ref 17592186352733 13194139535508 true] [17592186352729 1000 #edb/ref 17592186352734 13194139535508 true] [17592186352729 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535508 true] [17592186352729 1041 "selection" 13194139535508 true] [17592186352729 1104 #edb/ref 17592186352730 13194139535508 true] [17592186352729 1110 #uuid "18828e98-ced4-575f-b972-ee00bb68dc4c" 13194139535508 true] [17592186352730 1034 "\\sqrt{2}" 13194139535508 true] [17592186352730 1103 #edb