ed}{∬}_{S}\\,\\text{d}S & ={∬}_{D}\\sqrt{1+{(\\frac{∂z}{∂x})}^{2}+{(\\frac{∂z}{∂y})}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}\\sqrt{1+(-\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{4-{x}^{2}}})^{2}+(0)^{2}}\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}\\sqrt{1+\\frac{{x}^{2}}{4-{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}\\sqrt{\\frac{4}{4-{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{4-{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & =2{\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{2}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{4-{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2{\\int }_{0}^{1}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{4-{x}^{2}}}\\cdot y\\,{|}_{0}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =4{\\int }_{0}^{1}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{4-{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =4{\\int }_{0}^{1}\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{1-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{4}}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2{\\int }_{0}^{1}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{(\\frac{x}{2})}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSetting $u=\\frac{x}{2},$ we get $\\text{d}u=\\frac{1}{2}\\text{d}x.$ Also, the limits must be changed as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & 0 & 1 \\\\ u & 0 & \\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nSubstituting these into our integral, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2{\\int }_{0}^{1}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{(\\frac{x}{2})}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x & =2{\\int }_{0}^{1/2}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\cdot 2\\text{d}u \\\\  & =4{\\int }_{0}^{1/2}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =4\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡u\\,{|}_{0}^{1/2} \\\\  & =4(\\frac{\\pi }{6}-0) \\\\  & =\\frac{2\\pi }{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535508 true] [17592186352736 1000 #edb/ref 17592186352737 13194139535508 true] [17592186352736 1000 #edb/ref 17592186352738 13194139535508 true] [17592186352736 1000 #edb/ref 17592186352739 13194139535508 true] [17592186352736 1000 #edb/ref 17592186352740 13194139535508 true] [17592186352736 1000 #edb/ref 17592186352741 13194139535508 true] [17592186352736 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535508 true] [17592186352736 1041 "selection" 13194139535508 true] [17592186352736 1104 #edb/ref 17592186352738 13194139535508 true] [17592186352736 1110 #uuid "998aa330-474e-58e0